      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we have precompilation set the dst read strategy on the RenderPassDesc, but it was for a paint that didn\u0027t require dst reads, wouldn\u0027t we still be compiling a valid pipeline w/ a compatible renderpass for the eventual real rendering scenario of a DrawList with all draws not requiring dst reads?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 209,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 211,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "57c02efdc9462ce955f8339cc46ce5727a88bfb5",
